<title>USA: Harnischfeger Industries may issue debt.</title>
<headline>Harnischfeger Industries may issue debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harnischfeger Industries Inc is expected to tap the corporate bond new issue market with a $100 million debt offering, syndicate sources said on Thursdy.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to consist of a Baa2/BBB rated 10-year maturity via underwriters Lehman Brothers and Merrill Lynch &amp; Co, sources said.</p>
<p>The offering is expected to be launched later today, they added.</p>
<p>((--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675))</p>
</text>
